  "fresh_kernel_module": "PhotonJointModel",
  "scope": "Count-law distinction and joint snapshot interpretation for the explicit two 63-site iid Gaussian-phase/Poisson models, with positive variance/gain and common nonnegative background. The archived exact phase and symbolic coordinate arrays are parsed; coordinate exponentials and full count-law reindexing are proved. External byte selection, decimal rounding, complete homometry/graph formalization, temporal/exposure models, root/testing formalization, physical validation and novelty remain separate. See formal/COORDINATES.md and the linked historical scopes.",
